ribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=⟨0,0,3⟩$ and $b=⟨2,0,1⟩.$ Find $a\\times b.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-19782" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((0)(1)-(0)(3))i-((0)(1)-(2)(3))j+((0)(0)-(2)(0))k \\\\  & =(0-0)i-(0-6)j+(0-0)k \\\\  & =6j.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-19782" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1f9593abe2bcd968550617c130879f834c4232f5e69de9554b6a95fa36c71400"} {"question" "q-19782" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-19782" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "3i+8k"] ["math" "3k"] ["math" "4i-2j+3k"] ["math" "6j"] ["math" "8i"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-19782" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "6j"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-19787" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=⟨1,5,4⟩$ and $b=⟨2,3,0⟩.$ Find $a\\times b.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-19787" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 5 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 0\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((5)(0)-(3)(4))i-((1)(0)-(2)(4))j+((1)(3)-(2)(5))k \\\\  & =(0-12)i-(0-8)j+(3-10)k \\\\  & =-12i+8j-7k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-19787" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1f9593abe2bcd968550617c130879f834c4232f5e69de9554b6a95fa36c71400"} {"question" "q-19787" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-19787" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-12i+8j-7k"] ["math" "-14i+18j+6k"] ["math" "7i+8j-12k"] ["math" "8i+12j-17k"] ["math" "8i+12j-7k"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-19787" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-12i+8j-7k"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=⟨0,-2,3⟩,$ $b=⟨-2,1,-2x⟩$ and $|\\,a\\times b\\,|=\\sqrt{53}.$ Find $x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & -2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & -2x\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -2x\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ -2 & -2x\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(4x-3)i-(0+6)j+(0-4)k \\\\  & =⟨4x-3,-6,-4⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, computing the magnitude, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{(4x-3)^{2}+(-6)^{2}+(-4)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-24x+9+36+16} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-24x+61}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLastly, we solve for $x$ the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\,a\\times b\\,| & =\\sqrt{53} \\\\ \\sqrt{16{x}^{2}-24x+61} & =\\sqrt{53} \\\\ 16{x}^{2}-24x+61 & =53 \\\\ 16{x}^{2}-24x+8 & =0 \\\\ 2{x}^{2}-3x+1 & =0 \\\\ (2x-1)(x-1) & =0 \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{2},\\,1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $x=\\frac{1}{2},\\,1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1f9593abe2bcd968550617c130879f834c4232f5e69de9554b6a95fa36c71400"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "x=-1,\\,2"] ["math" "x=-2"] ["math" "x=1"] ["math" "x=\\frac{1}{2},\\,1"] ["math" "x=\\frac{1}{2},\\,2"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-103552" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "x=\\frac{1}{2},\\,1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-282145" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=-6i+3j+2k$ and $b=4i-j+5k.$ Find $a\\times b.$\n\n$a\\times b=$\n\n{{field-1}}$\\,i\\,+\\,$\n{{field-2}}$\\,j\\,-\\,$\n{{field-3}}$\\,k$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-282145" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -6 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & -1 & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 5\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-6 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 5\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-6 & 3 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(3\\cdot 5-2\\cdot -1)i-(-6\\cdot 5-2\\cdot 4)j+(-6\\cdot -1-3\\cdot 4)k \\\\  & =(15+2)i-(-30-8)j+(6-12)k \\\\  & =17\\,i+38\\,j-6\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be2053222c4644fd7af0690baed64"} {"question" "q-282145" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "1f9593abe2bcd968550617c130879f834c4232f5e69de9554b6a95fa36c71400"} {"question" "q-282145" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14042784/state.json" "file_sha256" "25e8d57437c26b0e0f4a1e241cb3803cbc7be